    "innovation": "This review paper synthesizes research on the connection between Arctic amplification and mid-latitude weather, organizing potential mechanisms into three dynamical pathways involving storm tracks, the jet stream, and planetary waves, and proposing how cryospheric changes can constructively interfere to influence extreme weather.",
